<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Arm Financial prices at $15.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Arm Financial prices at $15.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	  Arm Financial Group Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $15</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $14 - $16</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			8,000,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	    Morgan Stanley Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed number of shares and estimated price range were raised for the planned initial public offering in Arm Financial Group Inc to eight million shares from 5.75 million shares and $14 to $16 from $12 to $14 respectively.</p>
</text>
